{"version": 2, "width": 150, "height": 42, "timestamp": 1793468626, "title": "Ciphraud: encrypted LR round trip (real run)", "env": {"TERM": "xterm-256color"}}
[0.54183, "o", "Ciphraud - encrypted fraud scoring, logistic regression (20 features, 16-bit), one transaction\r\nClient and server are two separate processes talking over loopback HTTP.\r\n"]
[0.541865, "o", "\r\n== 1. Start the inference server (holds the compiled model, never a secret key)\r\n"]
[7.010552, "o", "server pid 460 listening on http://127.0.0.1:58429; model lr_top20_bits16 loaded\r\n\r\n== 2. Client side: load client artifact, generate keys\r\n"]
[11.995944, "o", "client artifact sha256 matches the served circuit: True\r\n"]
[11.996456, "o", "secret + evaluation keys generated on the CLIENT in 0.00 s (secret key stays in client memory)\r\n"]
[11.996795, "o", "evaluation (public) keys: 64 bytes, sha256 c69012816d87dcda...\r\n"]
[12.130875, "o", "uploaded evaluation keys only; server key_id c69012816d87dcda... (server never receives the secret key)\r\n\r\n== 3. Client side: preprocess, quantize, encrypt one transaction\r\n"]
[13.130199, "o", "plaintext transaction: validation row 32148, 20 raw features (stays on the client)\r\n"]
[13.135557, "o", "quantized input integers (client-only): [-31641, -31668, -31632, -31702, -31650, -31654, -31119, -32175, -31636, -31720, -31294, -31372, -31536, -31677, -31650, -31908, -31680, -31630, -31139, -31948]\r\n"]
[13.13558, "o", "encrypted in 5.1 ms -> ciphertext 744 bytes, sha256 b2aa02d908b612f7...\r\n\r\n== 4. Send ciphertext; the server computes on it without decrypting\r\n"]
[13.226348, "o", "request body 744 bytes (ciphertext only), response 17,920 bytes (still encrypted)\r\nserver FHE evaluation: 79.5 ms (this is the first, cold request on this server)\r\n\r\n== 5. Client side: decrypt and decide\r\ndecrypted integer(s): [-214667949]\r\nfraud probability 0.206024, threshold 0.708641 -> decision: not fraud\r\n\r\n== 6. Check against the plaintext-quantized model and the recorded Phase 10 reference\r\nreference integers (clear quantized model): [-214667949]\r\nequals clear-quantized model:      True\r\nequals Concrete simulation:        True\r\nequals recorded source-phase value: True\r\nEXACT INTEGER AGREEMENT: True\r\n\r\n== 7. What crossed the wire (client-side audit of every request body)\r\nPOST   /v1/keys                               64 bytes  evaluation_keys\r\nPOST   /v1/infer                             744 bytes  input_ciphertext\r\nevery body is evaluation keys or an input ciphertext: True\r\n\r\n== 8. Cleanup\r\n"]
[13.417481, "o", "server keys deleted; key still resident on server: False\r\n"]
[13.417558, "o", "\r\n"]
[13.417567, "o", "One request, one fixed validation row, loopback. A functional demonstration, not a benchmark.\r\n"]
[13.6822, "o", "server stopped (exit code -15)\r\n"]
